      "value": "<p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"toc\" data-host-id=\"23d33a86-c149-3b82-a91a-c47ce220f3e1\" data-macro-id=\"5614d8d2-d0ff-4a5f-b90f-38432e58c650\" data-content-id=\"721555309\" data-content-version=\"7\"></div></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Link to OKR</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://mu--se.atlassian.net/plugins/servlet/ac/okrplugin_prod/okrboard-company?project.key=AD&amp;project.id=10298#!/workspaces/5132/objectives/alignment/table?intervalIds=%5B75814%5D&amp;assigneeIds=%5B0%5D&amp;groupIds=%5B40209%5D&amp;gradeTypes=%5B0%5D&amp;OKRTypeIds=%5B0%5D&amp;dueDates=null&amp;startDates=null&amp;lastGradeUpdateDates=null&amp;lastComment=%5B0,null%5D&amp;labelIds=%5B0%5D&amp;stakeholderIds=%5B0%5D&amp;sortOrder=%5B%5D&amp;sortChildren=false&amp;expandedItems=%5B%221494773-0%22,%221939956-0%22%5D&amp;filterCollapsedItems=%5B%5D&amp;cff=%5B%5D&amp;editObjective=1494773\" rel=\"nofollow\">OKR</a></p></td></tr><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Status</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><span class=\"jira-issue conf-macro output-block\" data-jira-key=\"AD-3513\" data-client-id=\"SINGLE_d1985a03-3c98-365b-8107-f4cdc34a26f1_721555309_308924de99aa6c1f019a81a6ac900010\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"jira\" data-host-id=\"23d33a86-c149-3b82-a91a-c47ce220f3e1\" data-macro-id=\"bb56696f-baa6-4572-8850-204caa628bfc\" data-content-id=\"721555309\" data-content-version=\"7\">\n                    <a href=\"https://mu--se.atlassian.net/browse/AD-3513\" class=\"jira-issue-key\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-wait issue-placeholder\"></span>AD-3513</a>\n                            -\n            <span class=\"summary\">Getting issue details...</span>\n                                                <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-default issue-placeholder\">STATUS</span>\n                </span></p></div></td></tr><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">DRI / Project owner</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"a.danchenko\" href=\"/display/~a.danchenko\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50919004\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Alexander Danchenko</a> </p></div></td></tr><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Team</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"e.karpova\" href=\"/display/~e.karpova\" data-linked-resource-id=\"721574018\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Ekaterina Karpova</a>  <a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"s.karukes\" href=\"/display/~s.karukes\" data-linked-resource-id=\"210241326\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Sergey Karukes</a> </p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-ResearchandContext\">Research and Context</h1><p>Now that AppLovin is almost a monopolist in-app advertising we can not afford not to add them to our stack. As the Ad Ops Manager I want to maximize our revenue from our in-app interstitials by implementing the mediation platform from Applovin MAX. This will bring us extra $1000/day, because of additional demand and competition. </p><p data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"317\">We want to implement <strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"292\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">AppLovin MAX</span> mediation</strong> for interstitial ads to:</p><ul data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"429\"><li data-section-id=\"1k8sz2a\" data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"355\">Increase competition (more bidders)</li><li data-section-id=\"1cjn7rj\" data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"384\">Improve eCPM and fill rate</li><li data-section-id=\"1oi90gu\" data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"429\">Target <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"429\">+$1,000/day incremental revenue</strong></li></ul><h1 id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Hypothesis\">Hypothesis</h1><p>If we use the Applovin MAX platform to mediate the interstitials in the UG app we'll earn extra $1000/day because of additional demand and competition.</p><h2 id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Experimentdesigntemplate\">Experiment design template</h2><div class=\"rwui_expandable_item conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-name=\"ui-expand\" data-host-id=\"23d33a86-c149-3b82-a91a-c47ce220f3e1\" data-macro-id=\"c40f06f5-6e95-4b93-9a52-d1085b539669\" data-content-id=\"721555309\" data-content-version=\"7\">\n\t\t  \t<button class=\"rwui_expandable_item_title rwui_expand\" role=\"button\" onclick=\"RWUI.toggleExpandItem(this, event);\" id=\"rwui_expand-Integrationplan\" data-hash=\"expand-Integrationplan\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"rwui_item_icon rw_external_icon_plus\"></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIntegration plan\n\t  \t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t<div class=\"rwui_expandable_item_body rwui_body\">\n\t\t\t<h3 data-section-id=\"55lft2\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"721\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Phase1—Preparation&amp;Audit(2–3days)\">Phase 1 &mdash; Preparation &amp; Audit (2&ndash;3 days)</h3><h3 data-section-id=\"166nhbc\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"754\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-1.CurrentStackAssessment\">1. Current Stack Assessment</h3><ul data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"961\"><li data-section-id=\"132rx00\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"887\">Map current interstitial setup:<ul data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"887\"><li data-section-id=\"dffflr\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"838\">Networks (AdMob, Unity Ads, ironSource, etc.)</li><li data-section-id=\"efpd1r\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"862\">Waterfall structure</li><li data-section-id=\"1qqaf1x\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"887\">eCPM by geo/platform</li></ul></li><li data-section-id=\"p8hw4t\" data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"961\">Identify:<ul data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"961\"><li data-section-id=\"1bx2mcg\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"918\">Fill rate gaps</li><li data-section-id=\"wjxee6\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"942\">Low-performing geos</li><li data-section-id=\"dbqzuy\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"961\">Latency issues</li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"bt5yyc\" data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1178\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Phase2—MAXSDKIntegration(3–5days)\">Phase 2 &mdash; MAX SDK Integration (3&ndash;5 days)</h3><h3 data-section-id=\"1a4j9yz\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1202\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-1.SDKIntegration\">1. SDK Integration</h3><ul data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1352\"><li data-section-id=\"1qefj06\" data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1245\">Add <strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1229\">AppLovin MAX SDK</strong> (iOS + Android)</li><li data-section-id=\"bml577\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1352\">Ensure:<ul data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1352\"><li data-section-id=\"qyy96d\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1278\">Latest SDK version</li><li data-section-id=\"1j81ui5\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1315\">SKAdNetwork IDs configured (iOS)</li><li data-section-id=\"ql5bg\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1352\">GDPR/ATT consent flow integrated</li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"trkqf2\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1374\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-2.AdUnitSetup\">2. Ad Unit Setup</h3><ul data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1521\"><li data-section-id=\"3y4ci9\" data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1426\">Create <strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1409\">Interstitial Ad Units</strong> in MAX dashboard</li><li data-section-id=\"1a52ow3\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1521\">Separate by:<ul data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1521\"><li data-section-id=\"618nav\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1470\">Platform (iOS / Android)</li><li data-section-id=\"1yjmtko\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1521\">Potentially by geo tier (optional for scaling)</li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"ck3ezd\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1572\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Phase3—DemandIntegration(5–7days)\">Phase 3 &mdash; Demand Integration (5&ndash;7 days)</h3><h3 data-section-id=\"zejof1\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1605\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-1.AddCoreNetworksinMAX\">1. Add Core Networks in MAX</h3><p data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1641\">Prioritize high-performing bidders:</p><ul data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1906\"><li data-section-id=\"1m3r5ed\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1686\"><strong data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1686\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Google AdMob</span></strong></li><li data-section-id=\"ml3ldh\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1730\"><strong data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1730\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Meta Audience Network</span></strong></li><li data-section-id=\"1r6o91x\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1774\"><strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1774\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Unity Ads</span></strong></li><li data-section-id=\"1k8fs1h\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1818\"><strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1818\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">ironSource</span></strong></li><li data-section-id=\"vr2xzp\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1862\"><strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1862\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Mintegral</span></strong></li><li data-section-id=\"1v9jfxx\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1906\"><strong data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1906\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Pangle</span></strong></li></ul><p data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"2005\">👉 Enable <strong data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1946\">bidding (header bidding)</strong> wherever supported<br data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1968\"/>👉 Use <strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2005\">waterfall only as fallback</strong></p><h3 data-section-id=\"gds1uu\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2050\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Phase4—Testing&amp;QA(3–5days)\">Phase 4 &mdash; Testing &amp; QA (3&ndash;5 days)</h3><h3 data-section-id=\"jd9ikf\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2074\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-FunctionalTesting\">Functional Testing</h3><ul data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2206\"><li data-section-id=\"16wvjbe\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2097\">Ad load success rate</li><li data-section-id=\"tohqmt\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2117\">No crashes / ANRs</li><li data-section-id=\"1ajout8\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2143\">Frequency capping works</li><li data-section-id=\"cvl62s\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2206\">Correct triggers (e.g., after song views, navigation points)</li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"whqryv\" data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2230\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-RevenueValidation\">Revenue Validation</h3><ul data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2343\"><li data-section-id=\"122bzjv\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2293\">Compare:<ul data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2293\"><li data-section-id=\"13d5669\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2293\">MAX vs current mediation (A/B test if possible)</li></ul></li><li data-section-id=\"6bvjxl\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2343\">Validate:<ul data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2343\"><li data-section-id=\"c0nla9\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2321\">eCPM uplift</li><li data-section-id=\"1uvf7x8\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2343\">Fill improvements</li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"1kwwywn\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2391\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Phase5—A/BExperiment(7–14days)\">Phase 5 &mdash; A/B Experiment (7&ndash;14 days)</h3><h3 data-section-id=\"77pby9\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2402\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Setup\">Setup</h3><ul data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2480\"><li data-section-id=\"12yro26\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2480\">Split users:<ul data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2480\"><li data-section-id=\"1nhapl0\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2452\"><strong data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2434\">Control:</strong> Current mediation</li><li data-section-id=\"mms84o\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2480\"><strong data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2466\">Test:</strong> MAX mediation</li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"1nffli6\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2493\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Measure\">Measure</h3><ul data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2594\"><li data-section-id=\"1gx3wx0\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2516\">ARPDAU (primary KPI)</li><li data-section-id=\"1o8mkil\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2551\">Interstitial impressions per DAU</li><li data-section-id=\"1j3dg6r\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2558\">eCPM</li><li data-section-id=\"az7dc1\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2594\">Retention impact (very important)</li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"xtqdqw\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2613\" id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-DecisionRule\">Decision Rule</h3><ul data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2689\"><li data-section-id=\"19nxhz7\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2689\">Rollout if:<ul data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2689\"><li data-section-id=\"y3r1ck\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2655\">&ge; +10&ndash;15% ARPDAU uplift</li><li data-section-id=\"qzhqbd\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2689\">No significant retention drop</li></ul></li></ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\n\n</div><p><br/></p><h1 id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-DescriptionoftheSolution&amp;Mockups\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Description of the Solution &amp; Mockups</span></h1><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Documentation: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://dash.applovin.com/login\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;text-align: left;\">https://dash.applovin.com/login</a></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Login: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"mailto:a.danchenko@ultimate-guitar.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration: none;text-align: left;\">a.danchenko@ultimate-guitar.com</a><br style=\"text-align: left;\"/><span style=\"color:var(--ds-text-accent-lime-bolder,#37471f);\"><span>Password: </span>Work1234!</span></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.01em;\"><span style=\"color:var(--ds-text-accent-lime-bolder,#37471f);\">Keys: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://dash.applovin.com/o/account?r=3#keys\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://dash.applovin.com/o/account?r=3#keys</a></span></span></p><p>AppLovin Partner network params:</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"confluenceTh\">Ad Network</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"confluenceTh\">iOS Params</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"confluenceTh\">Android params</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><span class=\"sc-eIHaNI jsOBLU sc-jzJRlG fZefMd\"><span class=\"sc-cSHVUG gbMOVQ\">Google Bidding</span></span></p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Pubid: ca-app-pub-2956473600792339~4776262693</p><p>Unitid: ca-app-pub-2956473600792339/1370915936</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Pubid: ca-app-pub-2956473600792339~4776262693</p><p>Unitid: ca-app-pub-2956473600792339/4189964043</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><span class=\"sc-eIHaNI jsOBLU sc-jzJRlG fZefMd\"><span class=\"sc-cSHVUG gbMOVQ\">InMobi</span></span></p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">acid: 2ae8bc4b45724bb2b8f7bdb067fbe212<br/>plid: 10000495188</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>acid: 2ae8bc4b45724bb2b8f7bdb067fbe212</p><p>plid: <span style=\"color:var(--ds-background-accent-gray-bolder,#626f86);\">10000495777</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><span style=\"color:var(--ds-text,#172b4d);\">Unity</span></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">gid: 44f6a3fe-b159-420b-91e4-298223dc29a0<br/>pid: AppLovin_iOS_Interstitials</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">gid: 44f6a3fe-b159-420b-91e4-298223dc29a0<br/>pid: Applovin_Android_Interstitials</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 id=\"id-[20260331]UGInApp.ApplovinMAXPlatformforInterstitials[2026XXXX]-Execution\">Execution</h1><p><div id=\"refresh-module-2010274054\" class=\"refresh-module-id jira-table conf-macro output-block\" data-client-id=\"TABLE_d1985a03-3c98-365b-8107-f4cdc34a26f1_721555309_308924de99aa6c1f019a81a6ac900010_cHJvamVjdCA9IEFEIEFORCBpc3N1ZWtleSA9IEFELTM1MTMgT1IgKCJFcGljIExpbmsiID0gQUQtMzUxMyBvciBwYXJlbnQgaW4gKEFELTM1MTMpKSAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAg_aXNzdWVrZXlzdW1tYXJ5aXNzdWV0eXBlZHVlZGF0ZWFzc2lnbmVlc3RhdHVz\" data-jira-key=\"issue-table-TABLE_d1985a03-3c98-365b-8107-f4cdc34a26f1_721555309_308924de99aa6c1f019a81a6ac900010_cHJvamVjdCA9IEFEIEFORCBpc3N1ZWtleSA9IEFELTM1MTMgT1IgKCJFcGljIExpbmsiID0gQUQtMzUxMyBvciBwYXJlbnQgaW4gKEFELTM1MTMpKSAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAg_aXNzdWVrZXlzdW1tYXJ5aXNzdWV0eXBlZHVlZGF0ZWFzc2lnbmVlc3RhdHVz\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"jira\" data-host-id=\"23d33a86-c149-3b82-a91a-c47ce220f3e1\" data-macro-id=\"be162112-7af8-4886-a378-305c1a15d43d\" data-content-id=\"721555309\" data-content-version=\"7\">\n<p>\n     